homepage: https://leksah.org
bug-reports: https://github.com/leksah/leksah/issues
synopsis: An IDE written in Haskell
description:
    A fast, hackable development environment written in Haskell.  The UI is
    one reflex-dom program that runs as a native app (WKWebView on macOS,
    GTK4/WebKitGTK on Linux, WebView2 on Windows), serves itself to any
    browser, or compiles to JavaScript and runs entirely in-page.  Deep
    Haskell tooling (cabal workspaces, haskell-language-server, GHCi
    debugging) plus multi-language LSP support, tmux-backed terminals and
    built-in git panes.
category: Development, IDE, Editor
build-type: Simple
